1
00:00:00,068 --> 00:00:02,028
[CHANTS]
One of us, one of us.

2
00:00:04,281 --> 00:00:06,321
(Penny:)Well, what a thrill.

3
00:00:06,491 --> 00:00:10,031
- You're sitting in my spot.
- Oh, gee, you've gotta be kidding me.

4
00:00:10,203 --> 00:00:12,993
- Leonard, she's in my spot.
- Yeah, yeah.

5
00:00:13,165 --> 00:00:14,335
(Leonard:)See, here's the thing...

6
00:00:14,499 --> 00:00:18,339
(Leonard:)...after you leave,
I still have to live with him.

7
00:00:19,337 --> 00:00:21,877
(Penny:)I don't care. I'm taking a stand.

8
00:00:22,048 --> 00:00:24,048
(Penny:)Metaphorically.

9
00:00:24,384 --> 00:00:26,094
(Sheldon:)All right, that's it.

10
00:00:26,261 --> 00:00:30,181
(Sheldon:)- Strike three.
- Oh, strike three.

11
00:00:31,057 --> 00:00:32,347
(Penny:)I'm banished?

12
00:00:32,517 --> 00:00:34,857
(Penny:)- What the hell kind of crap is that?
LEONARD: Listen.

13
00:00:35,437 --> 00:00:37,767
(Leonard:)- Don't worry, I'll talk to him.
- Yeah, you do that.

14
00:00:37,939 --> 00:00:41,279
(Leonard:)Just so I know,
would you be open to taking his class?

15
00:00:45,197 --> 00:00:47,527
(Leonard:)You can do it online.

16
00:00:49,242 --> 00:00:52,912
So on our triangulation, we've narrowed
the location of the Top Model house...

17
00:00:53,079 --> 00:00:55,619
(Howard:)...to three square miles
in the Hollywood Hills.

18
00:00:55,916 --> 00:00:59,026
(Raj:)Or possibly Durham, North Carolina.

